        "title": "Alba: A Wildlife Adventure",
        "extract": "Alba: A Wildlife Adventure is a 2020 open-world adventure game developed and published by Ustwo Games. It was released on iOS, macOS and Windows in 2020, and for Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S in 2021. The Windows and console ports were published by PID Games along with Ustwo. The game focuses on exploring the island and conserving wildlife.\n\n",
